  "plain": "Scott Ramsay, a researcher looking into a reported 1948 crash of an unknown craft near Aztec, New Mexico, lists on podcast host Jesse Michels' show the people he says he spoke to directly about it. He names Doug Nolan, Ken Farley, a local preacher, the preacher's son, and one other man. If their accounts hold, it would mean the crash has living firsthand witnesses."
